# Modern segmented page tabs (LOCKED)

**Component:** `src/components/common/ModernSegmentedTabs.tsx`

## Rule
All Master / Store dashboard **page sub-navigation** (section switches, status filters, modal/page tab bars) MUST use **full modern toggle buttons** via `ModernSegmentedTabs`.

## Forbidden
- Plain text links with only underline / `border-b-2` as the active indicator
- Flat text-only tab rows without a filled active button surface

## Required look
- Segmented track: `rounded-2xl` bordered surface (`var(--surface)` / `var(--border)`)
- Active tab: solid filled button (`accent` prop → portal / blue / emerald / teal / indigo / rose) + white label + soft shadow
- Inactive: muted text + hover fill — still a button, not bare text
- Optional icon / count / badge supported by the shared component

## Scope
- Store Reports, SEO, Shipping, Social, WhatsApp, Coupons preview, Customers, Cart Offers, Backup, Google connect, Bulk import, Master Domains / Database, and **any new page tabs**
- Do **not** invent a second tab style. Import and reuse `ModernSegmentedTabs`.
- Invoice print templates / locked coffee storefront chrome / Visual Theme Builder inspector chrome are out of this rule unless they already use dashboard page tabs.

## i18n
AR chrome = Arabic only; EN = English only. Labels passed into tabs must already be locale-correct.
